                                                "sense_id": "4d1592ba-06ff-3eac-be03-88e4c8ea773e",
                                                "text": "Calotypes have a hazy and mysterious feeling about them and feel painterly in the way they look. Mastery of calotypes takes time. Every calotype is distinct and difficult to duplicate."
